# Hub listing media (no borrowed images)

## Do this

- Each product/dApp/game gets its **own** featured / logo art, or **no** image.
- When there is no dedicated asset, omit `featuredImage` / `image` / `logoImage` so UI falls back to `KxListingFeaturedPlaceholder` (or the shared listing placeholder tokens).
- Prefer generating or commissioning Kasparex-owned assets later; never copy another dApp’s Wix/CDN URL as a stand-in.

## Forbidden

- Reusing Send KREX / Capsule / Lockbox / Store / any other product’s `static.wixstatic.com` (or similar) image on a different product.
- Hotlinking third-party marketing art that is not licensed for that listing.
- Inventing a one-off “temporary” featured image from another card “just so it is not empty.”

## Placeholder

- Component: `KxListingFeaturedPlaceholder` (`src/components/kx/KxListingFeaturedPlaceholder.tsx`)
- Tokens: `KX_LISTING_PLACEHOLDER_*` in `src/lib/ui/kxListingPlaceholder.ts`
